{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhulv-e-o139","title":"琮以军出无获，议欲部分诸将有所掩袭；桓素气高耻见部伍，乃往见琮问行意，感激发怒，与琮校计","accounts":[{"id":"zhulv-a-e4a523e3ba42ad79a53d","label":"正文","text":"琮以军出无获，议欲部分诸将有所掩袭；桓素气高耻见部伍，乃往见琮问行意，感激发怒，与琮校计","evidence":["zhulv-q-d5587c5a2c30eb67afa7"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-9c58854713ac973499ac","label":"正文","text":"琮欲自解，因曰上自令胡综为督，综意以为宜尔；桓愈恚恨，还，乃使人呼综","evidence":["zhulv-q-f69d85e7ff41d571df0f"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-1f3594bdda4007e1ca41","label":"正文","text":"综至军门，桓出迎之，顾谓左右曰我纵手，汝等各自去；有一人旁出，语综使还；桓出不见综，知左右所为，因斫杀之","evidence":["zhulv-q-adebbab463eb27244bd9"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-0bea286b5a3983d92aff","label":"正文","text":"桓佐军进谏，桓刺杀佐军","evidence":["zhulv-q-6d78a0ff55a3df5c509d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0005","role":"议部而受诘者；自解者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d5587c5a2c30eb67afa7","zhulv-q-f69d85e7ff41d571df0f"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0028","role":"耻见部伍而怒者；愈恚恨者；出迎而斫杀左右者；刺杀佐军者","evidence":["zhulv-q-d5587c5a2c30eb67afa7","zhulv-q-f69d85e7ff41d571df0f","zhulv-q-adebbab463eb27244bd9","zhulv-q-6d78a0ff55a3df5c509d"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0091","role":"被呼者；至军门而被遣还者","evidence":["zhulv-q-f69d85e7ff41d571df0f","zhulv-q-adebbab463eb27244bd9"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zhulv-q-d5587c5a2c30eb67afa7","zhulv-q-f69d85e7ff41d571df0f","zhulv-q-adebbab463eb27244bd9","zhulv-q-6d78a0ff55a3df5c509d"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhulv-q-d5587c5a2c30eb67afa7","source_order":[56,257,26],"order":10034}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0005","name":"全琮","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0028","name":"朱桓","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0091","name":"胡综","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhulv-q-6d78a0ff55a3df5c509d","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-095501afb10788bf40e7","layer":"original","quote":"桓佐军进谏〖8〗，刺杀佐军","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":190,"end":203,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-adebbab463eb27244bd9","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-095501afb10788bf40e7","layer":"original","quote":"综至军门，桓出迎之。顾谓左右曰：“我纵手〖7〗，汝等各自去！”有一人旁出，语综使还。桓出，不见综；知左右所为，因斫杀之","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":130,"end":189,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-d5587c5a2c30eb67afa7","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-095501afb10788bf40e7","layer":"original","quote":"琮以军出无获，议欲部分诸将〖1〗，有所掩袭。桓素气高，耻见部伍〖2〗。乃往见琮，问行意；感激发怒〖3〗，与琮校计","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-f69d85e7ff41d571df0f","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-095501afb10788bf40e7","layer":"original","quote":"琮欲自解，因曰：“上自令胡综为督〖5〗，综意以为宜尔〖6〗。”桓愈恚恨，还，乃使人呼综","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":86,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
